  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "すっぱい　りんごを　たべて　しんか。\nやけどする　ほど　きょうさんせいの\nえきたいを　ほほぶくろに　ためる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "새콤한 사과를 먹고 진화했다.\n화상을 입을 정도로 강한 산성을 띠는\n액체를 볼주머니에 저장하고 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "啃果蟲吃了酸蘋果後進化\n而成。頰囊裡儲存著足以\n造成灼傷的強酸性液體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il a évolué après avoir mangé une pomme acide.\nIl concentre dans ses joues un liquide si corrosif\nqu’il peut provoquer des brûlures.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nach dem Verzehr eines sauren Apfels hat es sich\nentwickelt. In den Backentaschen speichert es\neine saure Substanz, die zu Verbrennungen führt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha evolucionado tras ingerir una manzana ácida.\nLas bolsas de las mejillas albergan un fluido cuya\nextrema acidez llega a provocar quemaduras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si è evoluto dopo aver mangiato una mela aspra.\nLe sacche sulle guance contengono un liquido\nestremamente acido che può provocare ustioni.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It ate a sour apple, and that induced its\nevolution. In its cheeks, it stores an acid\ncapable of causing chemical burns.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "すっぱい　りんごを　食べて　進化。\n火傷する　ほど　強酸性の\n液体を　頬袋に　溜める。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "啃果虫吃了酸苹果后进化\n而成。颊囊里储存着足以\n造成灼伤的强酸性液体。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ha evolucionado tras ingerir una manzana ácida.\nLas bolsas de las mejillas albergan un fluido cuya\nextrema acidez llega a provocar quemaduras.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sword",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/33/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "りんごの　かわの　つばさで　とんで\nきょうさんせいの　だえきを　とばす。\nりんごの　かたちに　へんけいする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "사과 껍질로 된 날개로 날며\n강산성의 타액을 뱉는다.\n사과의 형태로 변형한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會用蘋果皮的翅膀飛翔，\n並吐出強酸性的唾液。\n能變成蘋果的形狀。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il vole avec ses ailes faites de pelures de pomme\net crache une substance très acide.\nIl peut aussi prendre la forme de ce fruit.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon fliegt mit seinen Flügeln aus\nApfelschale und spuckt extrem sauren Speichel\naus. Es nimmt die Gestalt eines Apfels an.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escupe una saliva sumamente ácida y vuela con\nsus alas compuestas por piel de manzana, cuyo\naspecto es capaz de adoptar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Vola usando la buccia del pomo a mo’ di ali e\nsputa una saliva altamente acida. Può assumere\nl’aspetto di una mela.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It flies on wings of apple skin and spits a\npowerful acid. It can also change its shape\ninto that of an apple.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "りんごの　皮の　翼で　飛んで\n強酸性の　唾液を　飛ばす。\nりんごの　形に　変形する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会用苹果皮的翅膀飞翔，\n并吐出强酸性的唾液。\n可以变成苹果的形状。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Escupe una saliva sumamente ácida y vuela con\nsus alas compuestas por piel de manzana, cuyo\naspecto es capaz de adoptar.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/34/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "フラフラ　とびながら　すきを　ねらいきんぞくも　とかす　！\u0003\u0007強酸性きょうさんせい強酸性のえきたいを　はいて　こうげきする。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "비틀비틀 날면서 틈을 노린 뒤 금속조차 녹여 버리는 강산성의 액체를 뱉어서 공격한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會搖搖晃晃地飛在空中尋找可乘之機，然後吐出連金屬都能溶化的強酸性液體來攻擊目標。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon voltige en guettant ses adversaires. Le moment venu, il attaque en crachant un liquide si acide qu’il peut corroder le métal.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Erst sucht es herumflatternd nach gegnerischen Schwachstellen, um dann mit einer säurehaltigen Flüssigkeit zu spucken, die selbst Metall schmilzt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Revolotea hasta encontrar una brecha en la defensa del rival, que aprovecha para atacar con un fluido tan ácido que puede disolver metales.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Svolazza qua e là in attesa del momento giusto per attaccare sputando un liquido talmente acido da sciogliere persino il metallo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
